Temporary upstream bug workaround, not a permanent OSS/auth customization.

Related upstream reports:
https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/issues/21090
https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/issues/37800
https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/pull/37801

Opt in with LITELLM_ENABLE_RESPONSES_STREAMING_FIX=true; disabled by default.
Adapted metadata propagation, not a direct backport: honor explicit wildcard
supports_native_streaming without requiring base_model or exact graph entries.
Remove once the pinned upstream release passes verify_streaming.py without this
patch; a merged PR or closed issue alone is insufficient. Keep the regression
check. See README.md#temporary-streaming-bug-workaround for cleanup steps.

